    "content": "---\nexercise_name: Waiter curls\nexercise_type: strength\ntags:\n- biceps\naliases:\n- Сгибания «Официант» (Waiter Curls)\ncategory: arms\ntier: 3\nrank_source: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6g57DJntRXk\nvideo: https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=waiter%20curl\nhelper_id: 60\n---\n\n# Waiter curls\n\n**Better still** · [Biceps Exercises Ranked (BEST TO WORST!)](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6g57DJntRXk)\n\n**Target muscles:** Biceps\n\n## Starting position\n\nHold one dumbbell vertically with both palms cupped under the top plate (like a tray).\n\n## Step-by-step technique\n\n1. Curl the dumbbell up to your chin, keeping your palms parallel to the ceiling.\n\n## Key points\n\n- Loads the long head of the biceps.\n\n## Common mistakes\n\n- Clamping the dumbbell with your fingers.\n\n## Video\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=waiter%20curl\n"
