    "content": "---\nexercise_name: Dips (weighted or twisting optional)\nexercise_type: strength\ntags:\n- chest\n- front_delts\n- shoulders\n- triceps\naliases:\n- Отжимания на брусьях (можно с весом или со скручиванием)\ncategory: chest\ntier: 4\nrank_source: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ykQlXirszbo\nvideo: https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=chest%20dips\nequipment_bar: true\nhelper_id: 90\n---\n\n# Dips (weighted or twisting optional)\n\n**Almost best** · [Chest Exercises Ranked (BEST TO WORST!)](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ykQlXirszbo)\n\n**Target muscles:** Chest, triceps, front delts\n\n> [!warning] Requires a pull-up bar or parallel bars (dip bars).\n\n## Starting position\n\nSupport yourself on the dip bars with straight arms.\n\n## Step-by-step technique\n\n1. Lean your torso forward at about 30° and flare your elbows out slightly.\n2. Lower until you feel a comfortable stretch in your chest (roughly a 90° angle at the elbows).\n3. Press yourself back up.\n\n## Key points\n\n- The more you lean forward, the more your chest works (rather than your triceps).\n\n## Common mistakes\n\n- Sinking too deep at the bottom (risk of shoulder injury).\n\n## Video\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=chest%20dips\n"
