    "content": "---\nexercise_name: Hanging knee raise\nexercise_type: strength\ntags:\n- abs\naliases:\n- Подъём коленей в висе\ncategory: core\ntier: 3\nrank_source: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TqXwI1MWZks\nvideo: https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=hanging%20knee%20raise\nequipment_bar: true\nhelper_id: 88\n---\n\n# Hanging knee raise\n\n**Better still** · [Ab Exercises Ranked (BEST TO WORST!)](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TqXwI1MWZks)\n\n**Target muscles:** Abs, hip flexors\n\n> [!warning] Requires a pull-up bar or parallel bars (dip bars).\n\n## Starting position\n\nHang from a pull-up bar.\n\n## Step-by-step technique\n\n1. Exhale and pull your knees up to your chest, making sure to curl your pelvis up.\n\n## Key points\n\n- If your pelvis doesn't curl up, only your hip flexors are working, not your abs.\n\n## Common mistakes\n\n- Raising your legs by swinging.\n\n## Video\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=hanging%20knee%20raise\n"
