    "name": "Sliding tuck (towel on the floor)",
    "content": "---\nexercise_name: Sliding tuck (towel on the floor)\nexercise_type: strength\ntags:\n- abs\naliases:\n- \"Скользящий «тук» (Sliding Tuck, полотенце на полу)\"\ncategory: core\ntier: 5\nrank_source: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TqXwI1MWZks\nvideo: https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=sliding%20tuck%20abs%20towel\nhelper_id: 68\n---\n\n# Sliding tuck (towel on the floor)\n\n**Best** · [Ab Exercises Ranked (BEST TO WORST!)](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TqXwI1MWZks)\n\n**Target muscles:** Lower abs, hip flexors\n\n## Starting position\n\nGet into a push-up position with your feet on a towel/sliders on a smooth floor.\n\n## Step-by-step technique\n\n1. Without hopping, pull your feet toward your hands by curling your abs and sliding.\n\n## Key points\n\n- A controlled movement with no momentum.\n\n## Common mistakes\n\n- Arching your lower back in the plank position.\n\n## Video\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=sliding%20tuck%20abs%20towel\n"
