    "name": "Swiper",
    "content": "---\nexercise_name: Swiper\nexercise_type: strength\ntags:\n- obliques\n- abs\naliases:\n- Свайпер (Swiper)\ncategory: core\ntier: 4\nrank_source: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TqXwI1MWZks\nvideo: https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=swiper%20abs%20exercise%20athlean-x\nhelper_id: 66\n---\n\n# Swiper\n\n**Almost best** · [Ab Exercises Ranked (BEST TO WORST!)](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TqXwI1MWZks)\n\n**Target muscles:** Abs and obliques\n\n## Starting position\n\nLie on your back with your knees bent and your shoulder blades lifted.\n\n## Step-by-step technique\n\n1. Alternate reaching your right hand to your right heel, then your left hand to your left heel, along the sides.\n\n## Key points\n\n- Continuous tension on the rectus abdominis and obliques.\n\n## Common mistakes\n\n- Resting your neck on the floor between reps.\n\n## Video\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=swiper%20abs%20exercise%20athlean-x\n"
